            0.165,
            0.399,
            0.702,
            0.443
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Did you figure out what these numbers represent? Hint: Could their heights be playing a role?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.45,
            0.885,
            0.541
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A child says ‘1’ if there is only one taller child standing next to them. A child says ‘2’ if both the children standing next to them are taller. A child says ‘0’, if neither of the children standing next to them are taller. That is each person says the number of taller neighbours they have."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.168,
            0.557,
            0.196,
            0.579
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 4,
              "bbox": [
                0.168,
                0.557,
                0.196,
                0.579
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_1_image_4.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.558,
            0.81,
            0.58
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Try answering the questions below and share your reasoning."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.212,
            0.582,
            0.834,
            0.623
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. Can the children rearrange themselves so that the children standing at the ends say ‘2’?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.843,
            0.553,
            0.929,
            0.613
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 7,
              "bbox": [
                0.843,
                0.553,
                0.929,
                0.613
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_1_image_7.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.212,
            0.625,
            0.834,
            0.665
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "only 0s?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.212,
            0.668,
            0.834,
            0.708
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. Can two children standing next to each other say the same number?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.212,
            0.711,
            0.834,
            0.773
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. There are 5 children in a group, all of different heights. Can they stand such that four of them say ‘1’ and the last one says ‘0’? Why or why not?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.21,
            0.775,
            0.834,
            0.796
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5. For this group of 5 children, is the sequence 1, 1, 1, 1, 1 possible?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.212,
            0.797,
            0.765,
            0.817
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6. Is the sequence 0, 1, 2, 1, 0 possible? Why or why not?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.213,
            0.818,
            0.834,
            0.859
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7. How would you rearrange the five children so that the maximum number of children say ‘2’?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
